        ],
        "id": "S4",
        "text": "When the EpisodeFile subresource is requested, episodes that have a file include file details: path, size, date added, scene name, release group, languages, quality, media info, quality-cutoff-not-met flag, custom formats and score, indexer flags and release type."
      },
